# IMP-03 web typecheck, and why it aborts while a demo build exists
# command: pnpm -C autobyteus-web typecheck (twice with autobyteus-web/dist-mobile-demo/ present, once with it moved aside)
# commit: 0d197a73b9 (run before committing; same files)
# env: macOS, Node v22.23.1, 64 GB (53% free); the gate gives the Nuxt app's compiler a 4096 MB heap
# date: 2026-11-21
# result: Pass for this change. With dist-mobile-demo/ present (left by the investigation's demo build) the Nuxt app
#   project aborts out of heap: .nuxt/tsconfig.json includes ../**/* with allowJs, and its exclude list
#   (nuxt.config.ts:261) has ../dist-mobile/** but not ../dist-mobile-demo/**, so vue-tsc also loads the 13 MB
#   minified demo bundle. Moved aside, the gate passes at its baseline. Recorded as FU-001.

